  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RFSU TZ Men equal partner</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">RFSU Tz Men Equal partner</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall goal of the Tanzania Men as Equal Partners Project is to  empower communities to fully exercise their Rights to Sexual and      Reproductive Health as a basic human right. In implementation of ths  intervention, the primary target will be men while using methods and  lessons learnt from the Regional Young Men as Equal Partners project, and the projec is fully aligned to RFSU&apos;s vision and goals in SRHR.</narrative>
